WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 3.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:04.275
CERB Fraud.

00:00:04.275 --> 00:00:17.175
The government's pay first, verify later approach created an accountability gap of historic proportions, with an estimated 4.6 billion dollars distributed in questionable or ineligible payments.
